    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n*** To bid on this property, please register on www.sherryfitz.ie***\n\nSherry FitzGerald Brady O'Flaherty are delighted to present this four-bedroom semi-detached home offering an exciting opportunity for those looking for a property with genuine scope to create a wonderful family residence in one of Maynooth's most established residential areas.\n\nWhile the property itself would benefit from refurbishment and modernisation throughout, it provides well-proportioned accommodation and an excellent blank canvas for the discerning purchaser. Extending to approx. 1155 sqft (106.8sqm) and with the right vision, No. 29 could be transformed into a stylish and comfortable modern home, tailored entirely to the needs and tastes of its new owners.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, living room, kitchen/dining room and utility, four bedrooms and family bathroom, with the property also benefiting from a driveway to front and excellent sized rear gardens. \n\nCluain Aoibhinn is a mature and popular residential development, ideally located within easy reach of Maynooth town centre. All amenities including Maynooth University, Rail Sation, shops, are closeby."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.11m x 2.52m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.87m x 5.21m\nWith natural stone fireplace\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.21m x 5.21m\nWith fitted wall and floor units\n\nUtility Room - 3.12m x 2.52m\nPlumbed for washing machine & dryer\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.07m x 2.40m\nWith fitted wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.11m x 2.71m\nWith fitted wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.21m x 3.03m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.12m x 2.52m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.68m x 2.08m\nFull bathroom suite\n\nOutside - \nLarge Rear Garden. Garden Shed.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Excellent scope for refurbishment</li><li>Within easy walking distance of University Campus & Rail Station </li><li>Mature, popular residential estate</li><li>OFCH</li><li>Pleasing aspect looking over large green area</li><li>Double Glazed windows and PVC front door</li><li>South west facing rear garden</li><li>Vacant property ready for immediate occupation</li><li>Flooring, lighting and kitchen appliances included.</ul>"
      },
